{"file": "零号小队：北辰揽星河-第121集.mp4", "ep": 121, "duration": 64.8, "segments": [{"start": 0.18, "end": 1.18, "text": "真不考虑拜试"}, {"start": 1.7, "end": 3.35, "text": "多谢助局"}, {"start": 3.91, "end": 5.79, "text": "常来啊"}, {"start": 5.79, "end": 6.79, "text": "你下次给我打电话"}, {"start": 9.85, "end": 10.65, "text": "都打过了"}, {"start": 10.97, "end": 12.01, "text": "下次换个分局吧"}, {"start": 12.45, "end": 15.82, "text": "温辰"}, {"start": 16.14, "end": 17.04, "text": "有时间的话"}, {"start": 17.16, "end": 17.92, "text": "回来一趟吧"}, {"start": 20.34, "end": 21.14, "text": "非南州分局"}, {"start": 21.34, "end": 21.74, "text": "是"}, {"start": 22.34, "end": 22.78, "text": "怎么了"}, {"start": 23.18, "end": 23.82, "text": "到了再说"}, {"start": 24.46, "end": 25.69, "text": "发生了什么"}, {"start": 26.05, "end": 26.85, "text": "十天前开始"}, {"start": 27.01, "end": 28.53, "text": "南京二区突然频繁出现漏洞"}, {"start": 28.69, "end": 30.25, "text": "到今天已经一百三十二处"}, {"start": 30.49, "end": 31.13, "text": "我们一直补"}, {"start": 31.25, "end": 32.17, "text": "但频率太不正常"}, {"start": 32.45, "end": 33.09, "text": "能修补的人"}, {"start": 33.09, "end": 33.89, "text": "连二十个都不到"}, {"start": 34.01, "end": 34.65, "text": "照这样下去"}, {"start": 34.81, "end": 35.49, "text": "模组没进来"}, {"start": 35.61, "end": 36.33, "text": "我们先被拖垮"}, {"start": 36.45, "end": 37.69, "text": "去最近出现漏洞的地方"}, {"start": 37.89, "end": 38.29, "text": "好"}, {"start": 38.81, "end": 40.58, "text": "齐玄"}, {"start": 41.57, "end": 42.01, "text": "是我"}, {"start": 42.99, "end": 43.87, "text": "我是许兴辉"}, {"start": 44.23, "end": 45.15, "text": "看过你的展示"}, {"start": 45.35, "end": 45.99, "text": "有空聊聊"}, {"start": 46.58, "end": 47.06, "text": "好啊"}, {"start": 47.3, "end": 47.9, "text": "徐老师"}, {"start": 48.82, "end": 49.86, "text": "应该能学到不少"}, {"start": 50.86, "end": 51.54, "text": "这位是"}, {"start": 52.67, "end": 53.39, "text": "宁燕叔"}, {"start": 53.51, "end": 54.07, "text": "您好"}]}